{"duration": 214.8, "lines": [{"id": "c1", "scene": "cold", "text": "Going $500 over a line cost Linda $1,148.", "start": 0, "end": 6.027, "words": [{"w": "Going", "start": 0, "end": 0.32}, {"w": "$500", "start": 0.48, "end": 0.72}, {"w": "over", "start": 0.8, "end": 1.84}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.92, "end": 1.96}, {"w": "line", "start": 2, "end": 2.4}, {"w": "cost", "start": 2.64, "end": 2.88}, {"w": "Linda", "start": 2.96, "end": 3.36}, {"w": "$1,148", "start": 3.44, "end": 6.027}]}, {"id": "c2", "scene": "cold", "text": "That's not a tax bracket.", "start": 7.12, "end": 8.8, "words": [{"w": "That's", "start": 7.12, "end": 7.36}, {"w": "not", "start": 7.44, "end": 7.52}, {"w": "a", "start": 7.6, "end": 7.64}, {"w": "tax", "start": 7.68, "end": 8}, {"w": "bracket", "start": 8.08, "end": 8.8}]}, {"id": "c3", "scene": "cold", "text": "That's a cliff.", "start": 9.04, "end": 10.28, "words": [{"w": "That's", "start": 9.04, "end": 9.24}, {"w": "a", "start": 9.28, "end": 9.36}, {"w": "cliff", "start": 9.44, "end": 10.28}]}, {"id": "c4", "scene": "cold", "text": "And this one hides inside your Medicare bill.", "start": 10.56, "end": 13.6, "words": [{"w": "And", "start": 10.56, "end": 10.72}, {"w": "this", "start": 10.8, "end": 10.96}, {"w": "one", "start": 11.04, "end": 11.2}, {"w": "hides", "start": 11.36, "end": 11.6}, {"w": "inside", "start": 11.68, "end": 12.16}, {"w": "your", "start": 12.24, "end": 12.32}, {"w": "Medicare", "start": 12.4, "end": 12.72}, {"w": "bill", "start": 12.8, "end": 13.6}]}, {"id": "l1", "scene": "linda", "text": "Meet Linda.", "start": 14.08, "end": 15, "words": [{"w": "Meet", "start": 14.08, "end": 14.24}, {"w": "Linda", "start": 14.32, "end": 15}]}, {"id": "l2", "scene": "linda", "text": "She's 66, she's retired, and she files single.", "start": 15.28, "end": 18.8, "words": [{"w": "She's", "start": 15.28, "end": 15.52}, {"w": "66", "start": 15.64, "end": 16.56}, {"w": "she's", "start": 16.6, "end": 16.72}, {"w": "retired", "start": 16.8, "end": 17.6}, {"w": "and", "start": 17.64, "end": 17.68}, {"w": "she", "start": 17.76, "end": 17.84}, {"w": "files", "start": 17.92, "end": 18.24}, {"w": "single", "start": 18.32, "end": 18.8}]}, {"id": "l3", "scene": "linda", "text": "In 2024, her roof started leaking.", "start": 19.52, "end": 22.24, "words": [{"w": "In", "start": 19.52, "end": 19.68}, {"w": "2024", "start": 19.8, "end": 20.88}, {"w": "her", "start": 20.96, "end": 21.04}, {"w": "roof", "start": 21.12, "end": 21.36}, {"w": "started", "start": 21.44, "end": 21.68}, {"w": "leaking", "start": 21.76, "end": 22.24}]}, {"id": "l4", "scene": "linda", "text": "So she pulled an extra $14,000 out of her IRA to fix it.", "start": 22.8, "end": 27.2, "words": [{"w": "So", "start": 22.8, "end": 22.88}, {"w": "she", "start": 22.96, "end": 23.12}, {"w": "pulled", "start": 23.2, "end": 23.36}, {"w": "an", "start": 23.44, "end": 23.52}, {"w": "extra", "start": 23.6, "end": 23.92}, {"w": "$14,000", "start": 24.08, "end": 24.48}, {"w": "out", "start": 24.64, "end": 25.6}, {"w": "of", "start": 25.64, "end": 25.68}, {"w": "her", "start": 25.76, "end": 25.84}, {"w": "IRA", "start": 26, "end": 26.48}, {"w": "to", "start": 26.56, "end": 26.64}, {"w": "fix", "start": 26.72, "end": 26.88}, {"w": "it", "start": 26.96, "end": 27.2}]}, {"id": "l5", "scene": "linda", "text": "That pushed her income for the year to $109,500.", "start": 27.92, "end": 32.56, "words": [{"w": "That", "start": 27.92, "end": 28.16}, {"w": "pushed", "start": 28.24, "end": 28.44}, {"w": "her", "start": 28.48, "end": 28.56}, {"w": "income", "start": 28.64, "end": 28.96}, {"w": "for", "start": 29.04, "end": 29.12}, {"w": "the", "start": 29.2, "end": 29.28}, {"w": "year", "start": 29.36, "end": 29.6}, {"w": "to", "start": 29.76, "end": 29.92}, {"w": "$109,500", "start": 30, "end": 32.56}]}, {"id": "l6", "scene": "linda", "text": "And nothing happened.", "start": 33.2, "end": 34.4, "words": [{"w": "And", "start": 33.2, "end": 33.36}, {"w": "nothing", "start": 33.44, "end": 33.76}, {"w": "happened", "start": 33.84, "end": 34.4}]}, {"id": "l7", "scene": "linda", "text": "Her taxes went up a little, the way a bucket should.", "start": 34.88, "end": 37.52, "words": [{"w": "Her", "start": 34.88, "end": 34.96}, {"w": "taxes", "start": 35.04, "end": 35.44}, {"w": "went", "start": 35.52, "end": 35.6}, {"w": "up", "start": 35.68, "end": 35.76}, {"w": "a", "start": 35.8, "end": 35.84}, {"w": "little", "start": 36, "end": 36.4}, {"w": "the", "start": 36.44, "end": 36.48}, {"w": "way", "start": 36.56, "end": 36.64}, {"w": "a", "start": 36.68, "end": 36.72}, {"w": "bucket", "start": 36.8, "end": 37.04}, {"w": "should", "start": 37.12, "end": 37.52}]}, {"id": "m1", "scene": "letter", "text": "Then, near the end of 2025, a letter showed up.", "start": 38.4, "end": 42.16, "words": [{"w": "Then", "start": 38.4, "end": 39.04}, {"w": "near", "start": 39.12, "end": 39.2}, {"w": "the", "start": 39.28, "end": 39.36}, {"w": "end", "start": 39.44, "end": 39.6}, {"w": "of", "start": 39.68, "end": 39.76}, {"w": "2025", "start": 39.84, "end": 41.12}, {"w": "a", "start": 41.16, "end": 41.2}, {"w": "letter", "start": 41.28, "end": 41.52}, {"w": "showed", "start": 41.6, "end": 41.8}, {"w": "up", "start": 41.84, "end": 42.16}]}, {"id": "m2", "scene": "letter", "text": "Starting in January, her Medicare Part B premium would jump from $202.90 to $284.10 a month.", "start": 42.8, "end": 52.96, "words": [{"w": "Starting", "start": 42.8, "end": 43.12}, {"w": "in", "start": 43.2, "end": 43.28}, {"w": "January", "start": 43.56, "end": 44.24}, {"w": "her", "start": 44.28, "end": 44.32}, {"w": "Medicare", "start": 44.4, "end": 44.8}, {"w": "Part", "start": 44.88, "end": 45.12}, {"w": "B", "start": 45.2, "end": 45.36}, {"w": "premium", "start": 45.44, "end": 45.92}, {"w": "would", "start": 46.08, "end": 46.24}, {"w": "jump", "start": 46.32, "end": 46.48}, {"w": "from", "start": 46.56, "end": 46.72}, {"w": "$202.90", "start": 46.88, "end": 47.28}, {"w": "to", "start": 47.44, "end": 47.52}, {"w": "$284.10", "start": 47.68, "end": 48}, {"w": "a", "start": 48.08, "end": 48.133}, {"w": "month", "start": 48.28, "end": 52.96}]}, {"id": "m3", "scene": "letter", "text": "Plus $14.50 a month more for her drug plan.", "start": 53.12, "end": 57.6, "words": [{"w": "Plus", "start": 53.12, "end": 53.28}, {"w": "$14.50", "start": 53.52, "end": 53.84}, {"w": "a", "start": 54, "end": 54.213}, {"w": "month", "start": 54.4, "end": 55.52}, {"w": "more", "start": 55.6, "end": 55.92}, {"w": "for", "start": 56, "end": 56.08}, {"w": "her", "start": 56.16, "end": 56.24}, {"w": "drug", "start": 56.32, "end": 56.48}, {"w": "plan", "start": 56.56, "end": 57.6}]}, {"id": "m4", "scene": "letter", "text": "That's $1,148 a year.", "start": 57.72, "end": 61.44, "words": [{"w": "That's", "start": 57.72, "end": 58}, {"w": "$1,148", "start": 58.08, "end": 58.64}, {"w": "a", "start": 58.88, "end": 60.213}, {"w": "year", "start": 60.36, "end": 61.44}]}, {"id": "m5", "scene": "letter", "text": "For a roof she fixed two years ago.", "start": 61.52, "end": 64.12, "words": [{"w": "For", "start": 61.52, "end": 61.6}, {"w": "a", "start": 61.64, "end": 61.68}, {"w": "roof", "start": 61.76, "end": 62}, {"w": "she", "start": 62.12, "end": 62.24}, {"w": "fixed", "start": 62.44, "end": 62.64}, {"w": "two", "start": 62.76, "end": 62.88}, {"w": "years", "start": 62.96, "end": 63.2}, {"w": "ago", "start": 63.28, "end": 64.12}]}, {"id": "m6", "scene": "letter", "text": "Linda called Social Security and asked if they'd made a mistake.", "start": 64.64, "end": 68.48, "words": [{"w": "Linda", "start": 64.64, "end": 64.96}, {"w": "called", "start": 65.12, "end": 65.28}, {"w": "Social", "start": 65.44, "end": 65.6}, {"w": "Security", "start": 65.68, "end": 66.24}, {"w": "and", "start": 66.32, "end": 66.48}, {"w": "asked", "start": 66.6, "end": 66.8}, {"w": "if", "start": 66.84, "end": 66.88}, {"w": "they'd", "start": 66.96, "end": 67.12}, {"w": "made", "start": 67.2, "end": 67.28}, {"w": "a", "start": 67.32, "end": 67.36}, {"w": "mistake", "start": 67.48, "end": 68.48}]}, {"id": "m7", "scene": "letter", "text": "They hadn't.", "start": 68.56, "end": 69.44, "words": [{"w": "They", "start": 68.56, "end": 68.64}, {"w": "hadn't", "start": 68.72, "end": 69.44}]}, {"id": "r1", "scene": "rule", "text": "The rule is called IRMAA.", "start": 69.76, "end": 72.08, "words": [{"w": "The", "start": 69.76, "end": 69.84}, {"w": "rule", "start": 69.92, "end": 70.16}, {"w": "is", "start": 70.24, "end": 70.4}, {"w": "called", "start": 70.56, "end": 70.72}, {"w": "IRMAA", "start": 70.96, "end": 72.08}]}, {"id": "r2", "scene": "rule", "text": "Medicare looks at your tax return from two years back.", "start": 72.16, "end": 75.52, "words": [{"w": "Medicare", "start": 72.16, "end": 72.56}, {"w": "looks", "start": 72.64, "end": 72.8}, {"w": "at", "start": 72.88, "end": 72.92}, {"w": "your", "start": 72.96, "end": 73.04}, {"w": "tax", "start": 73.12, "end": 73.36}, {"w": "return", "start": 73.44, "end": 73.76}, {"w": "from", "start": 73.84, "end": 74}, {"w": "two", "start": 74.08, "end": 74.24}, {"w": "years", "start": 74.32, "end": 74.56}, {"w": "back", "start": 74.64, "end": 75.52}]}, {"id": "r3", "scene": "rule", "text": "And income here means more than a paycheck.", "start": 75.6, "end": 78.08, "words": [{"w": "And", "start": 75.6, "end": 75.68}, {"w": "income", "start": 75.84, "end": 76.16}, {"w": "here", "start": 76.24, "end": 76.56}, {"w": "means", "start": 76.64, "end": 76.88}, {"w": "more", "start": 77.04, "end": 77.2}, {"w": "than", "start": 77.28, "end": 77.36}, {"w": "a", "start": 77.413, "end": 77.467}, {"w": "paycheck", "start": 77.52, "end": 78.08}]}, {"id": "r4", "scene": "rule", "text": "Medicare even adds back tax-free municipal bond interest.", "start": 78.72, "end": 82.32, "words": [{"w": "Medicare", "start": 78.72, "end": 79.2}, {"w": "even", "start": 79.28, "end": 79.52}, {"w": "adds", "start": 79.6, "end": 79.84}, {"w": "back", "start": 79.92, "en